    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Change request approvals (Enterprise)\n\nPost change requests sent to review to the approvers' Slack channel, and confirm when one is applied.\n\n**Requires Unleash Enterprise** — only Enterprise has change requests. [Start a trial](https://www.getunleash.io/plans/enterprise-payg).\n\n**Setup in Unleash:**\n1. Add a Webhook node (already here) with a Header Auth credential holding a random secret, and copy its Production URL.\n2. In Unleash, open Integrations > Webhook, paste the URL, put the same secret in the Authorization field, and select at least `change-request-sent-to-review` and `change-request-applied`.\n3. Connect your own Slack credential and set the approvers' channel. On n8n 3.0+, that credential needs a Signature Secret before it can be saved.\n\nDeduplicates on the event **id** on each branch, since Unleash retries a failed delivery once and events can arrive twice or out of order. Add the other change-request events (`change-request-approved`, `change-request-cancelled`, `change-request-scheduled-application-failure`) as more Switch rules if you want them too.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 460
      },
